      ],
      "chunk_id": "64f32d21-dc10-42cc-b275-395f3ef6f1e6",
      "content": "Health Benefits\n\nNorthstar provides health, dental, and vision benefits to eligible full-time employees. Coverage begins on the first day of the month after the employee's start date. Plan details vary by employee location.\n\nThis overview does not include provider contracts, claim adjudication rules, or legal advice about benefits eligibility.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "67bd1b4b-6acc-43d0-8a40-a049d27b6329",
      "content": "Benefits Support\n\nEmployees should contact the benefits support queue for enrollment questions, coverage questions, or life event changes. Urgent benefits questions should not be posted in public team channels.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "06d7e7e5-b2f6-4da6-b5f6-987b10266c52",
      "content": "Wellness Stipend\n\nEligible full-time employees receive a wellness stipend of 750 CAD or 550 USD per calendar year, based on payroll country. The stipend may be used for fitness memberships, mental health apps, ergonomic equipment, or wellness programs.\n\nUnused wellness stipend amounts do not carry over into the next calendar year.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "79e28ac2-ea1b-45ff-9a0d-d5ca18b2b19e",
      "content": "Vacation Entitlement\n\nFull-time employees receive 20 paid vacation days per calendar year. Vacation is accrued monthly and may be used after the employee's first 30 days of employment. Part-time employees receive prorated vacation based on scheduled weekly hours.\n\nEmployees may carry over up to 5 unused vacation days into the next calendar year. Carried-over days must be used by March 31 or they expire unless local law requires a different outcome.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "3c0ff18d-c2c6-4655-b39f-b0594d3ea77d",
      "content": "Onboarding Basics\n\nNew employees complete onboarding during their first 10 business days. Required onboarding includes security training, benefits enrollment, department orientation, and access review. Managers are responsible for assigning a buddy and scheduling the first 30-day check-in.\n\nEmployees should complete mandatory security awareness training before accessing customer data or production systems.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
